## Context

The ratified target-neutral harness assigns its in-process-plugin architecture
seat to `introfini/ZotSeek` while that project remains runnable and inspectable.
Ticket 0578 builds the layer and first adapter. ZotSeek declares MIT only in
`package.json` and has no LICENSE file, so this work may run and inspect it but
must not copy its code into this repository.

## Actions

1. Pin a runnable ZotSeek revision and record the eligibility check.
2. Declare its sidecar-derived state, in-process/UI query access, lifecycle,
   default configuration and unsupported interface verbs.
3. Add only the minimal invocation transport and run the shared assertions.
4. If ZotSeek is no longer runnable or inspectable, report that finding and
   propose another in-process Zotero plugin; do not silently substitute one.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] pinned ZotSeek revision is runnable and inspectable, or replacement is
      explicitly proposed for the same architecture seat
- [ ] adapter passes ticket 0578's declaration-only contract checks
- [ ] no ZotSeek code is copied into this repository
- [ ] every interface verb yields pass, fail, not-offered or not-run
- [ ] `make check` and `erg check tickets/` pass
